{
  "durationInSeconds": 104.45745833333334,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 6.0729999999999995,
      "text": "This man won seven point seven million pounds at a London casino, without touching the cards that won it."
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 6.372875,
      "end": 9.478874999999999,
      "text": "This game is pure chance, and the house keeps about a one percent edge."
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 9.5985,
      "end": 13.189499999999999,
      "text": "But the pattern on these cards sat less than a millimeter off center."
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 13.309208333333332,
      "end": 15.771208333333332,
      "text": "So one long edge looked slightly different from the other."
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 15.891666666666666,
      "end": 19.136666666666667,
      "text": "Alone, that was useless, because every card had the same flaw."
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "start": 19.256916666666665,
      "end": 23.433916666666665,
      "text": "Phil Ivey needed the good cards facing one way, and the rest facing the other."
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 23.734291666666664,
      "end": 26.297291666666663,
      "text": "But at this table, only the dealer touches the cards."
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 26.417624999999997,
      "end": 28.245624999999997,
      "text": "So his partner asked her for a small favor."
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 28.36545833333333,
      "end": 30.681458333333328,
      "text": "Turn the good ones this way, and the bad ones that way."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 31.13104166666666,
      "end": 32.47004166666666,
      "text": "To change the luck, she said."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 32.590041666666664,
      "end": 33.858041666666665,
      "text": "Casinos hear that all the time."
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "start": 33.97754166666667,
      "end": 35.36454166666667,
      "text": "The dealer had no idea why."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 35.86420833333334,
      "end": 38.87220833333334,
      "text": "Then Ivey said he had won with those cards, and wanted to keep them."
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 38.992291666666674,
      "end": 39.89629166666668,
      "text": "The casino agreed."
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 40.01583333333334,
      "end": 43.11783333333334,
      "text": "A shuffling machine mixed them without turning a single one."
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 43.23791666666667,
      "end": 45.49091666666667,
      "text": "Now the back of the next card gave it away."
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "start": 45.61129166666667,
      "end": 48.814291666666676,
      "text": "One percent for the house could become six and a half for him."
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 49.11420833333334,
      "end": 51.69920833333334,
      "text": "His bets had started as low as four thousand pounds."
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 51.81954166666667,
      "end": 54.84154166666667,
      "text": "Now they hit one hundred and fifty thousand, the casino's limit."
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 54.961291666666675,
      "end": 58.73629166666667,
      "text": "In one stretch, he read the next card right seventeen times out of nineteen."
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 58.85637500000001,
      "end": 62.17037500000001,
      "text": "In two days, he was up seven point seven million pounds."
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 62.29016666666667,
      "end": 66.62416666666667,
      "text": "That same year, the pair took an American casino for nine point six million dollars."
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s5",
      "start": 66.74425000000001,
      "end": 67.92125000000001,
      "text": "That casino paid."
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 68.77095833333334,
      "end": 70.14195833333333,
      "text": "London did not."
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 70.74166666666667,
      "end": 73.16166666666668,
      "text": "Nine days later, they told him the game was compromised."
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 73.28145833333335,
      "end": 76.29445833333335,
      "text": "They handed back his one million pound stake, and nothing else."
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 76.41400000000002,
      "end": 80.26200000000001,
      "text": "Ivey sued, admitted everything, and insisted it was not cheating."
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 80.38191666666668,
      "end": 81.43891666666669,
      "text": "The judge believed he meant it."
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 81.55891666666669,
      "end": 83.5929166666667,
      "text": "Five years later, it reached the Supreme Court."
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 83.71291666666669,
      "end": 85.32991666666669,
      "text": "All five justices ruled against him."
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 86.12975000000002,
      "end": 88.96575000000001,
      "text": "He had fixed the deck, they said, using the dealer as his hands."
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s6",
      "start": 89.08575000000002,
      "end": 91.86575000000002,
      "text": "Clever, skillful, and still cheating."
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 92.46625000000002,
      "end": 96.96425000000002,
      "text": "In America, a judge found no fraud, but ordered ten point one million dollars back."
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s7",
      "start": 97.08462500000002,
      "end": 99.10562500000002,
      "text": "They later settled, terms undisclosed."
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s8",
      "start": 99.40604166666668,
      "end": 101.25904166666668,
      "text": "The flaw was in their own deck."
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s8",
      "start": 101.37904166666668,
      "end": 102.63904166666669,
      "text": "You own that casino."
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s8",
      "start": 103.08891666666668,
      "end": 104.15791666666668,
      "text": "Do you pay him?"
    }
  ]
}
